 ed to host a lunch and moderated Q&amp\;A with <a href="https://aas.emory
 .edu/people/bios/faculty/anderson-carol.html">Carol Anderson</a>\, bestse
 lling author\, preeminent historian of African American history and oppre
 ssion\, and an influential voice of civil and voting rights.</p>
